# Coding Style

The root and nearest domain `AGENTS.md` are authoritative. Apply this rule only
when it does not conflict with those files.

Validate at trust and IPC boundaries. Preserve established mutation and error
handling patterns instead of imposing a repository-wide abstraction.

Prefer focused functions and modules, but treat size as a review signal rather
than a hard limit. Use named constants instead of duplicated magic values.
